            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Assistant title may not bid on other job opportunities, unless they are subject to force adjustment. Upon successful completion of all training, testing, and performance requirements, and the passing of the required tests for the COE Installer-Repairer position, the employee will be awarded the position of central office based COE Installer-Repairer. The location will be determined by the Company with input from the employee, based upon availability and service requirements.",
