        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "4. If an employee in the Equipment Installer Assistant title is a direct hire and is unable to successfully meet expectations as outlined, the employee will be released from employment with the Company. Employees released as outlined in the forgoing will have no recourse through the grievance and or arbitration process as outlined in the Collective Bargaining Agreement.",
