        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "5. An existing employee who accepts the Equipment Installer Assistant title and is unsuccessful in meeting expectations as outlined, shall be returned to their previous position and reporting location, if available. Should the previous position not be available for any reason, the employee may be placed into any other vacancy for which he/she is qualified as determined by the Company. Being qualified includes successfully passing any requirement job test associated with the position. Should the employee be unsuccessful in obtaining a position, the employee will be released from the company.",
